  "notes": "Python: tests/test_inbound_turns_record.py::test_a_turn_that_wrote_no_message_names_its_end_to_the_caller (room-1) and test_two_agents_each_keep_their_own_end (room-2). Each agent's loop allows one round of calls. In room-2, cut also answers done's reply: six generations in all, each round one call.",
